      934        flt-code AT ROW 2.5 COL 12 COLON-ALIGNED
      935        br-obj AT ROW 3.75 COL 2
      936        SPACE(0.99) SKIP(0.62)
      937       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
      938            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
      939            TITLE "Объекты пользователя":L.
      940   ASSIGN
      941          FRAME DIALOG-1:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE.
      942   ASSIGN
      943          B-list:POPUP-MENU IN FRAME DIALOG-1       = MENU MENU-B-list:HANDLE.
      944   ASSIGN
      945          br-obj:NUM-LOCKED-COLUMNS IN FRAME DIALOG-1     = 3.
      946   ON GO OF FRAME DIALOG-1
      947   DO:
      948     run choose-select in this-procedure
      949       no-error .
      950     if error-status :error
      951     then do:
      952       undo, return no-apply .
